From 1e460aca51dd009d580edff0ef491b795a9a17cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zswll2 <zswll2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 08:26:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/32] feat(desktop): browser bridge shim for the web build
 (window.hermesDesktop)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

createWebBridge() implements the P0 data plane members for real — same-origin
REST via api() (X-Hermes-Session-Token header in token mode, cookies in gated
mode), a synthetic always-remote HermesConnection, per-dial WS URL minting
(ws-ticket when the dashboard gate is on, injected token on loopback) — and
structurally degrades every machine-bound member with WebBridgeCapabilityError
(one-time console.warn per capability) so misrouted calls are visible instead
of silent undefined. TypeScript verifies member completeness against
Window['hermesDesktop']; 19 vitest contract tests pin the auth/fetch shapes.

index.html gains the iOS install surface (manifest link, apple-mobile-web-app
metas, relative icon paths) and public/manifest.webmanifest (no SW by design:
the server injects per-process session tokens into HTML).
